300	     at y:48, exactly below the topline, and both cell heights shrink by
301	     the same 48px so the bottom still lands flush on the viewport edge -
302	     the R6 §3 gap this block fixed doesn't reopen, because now BOTH the
303	     offset and the height account for the topline, not just the height. */
304	  .showcase-embed-cell{height:calc(100svh - 48px);}
