478	.img-cell{position:relative;}
479	/* R3: §3 dither -> colour grid-stagger. The tile grid sits over the
480	   already-visible colour layer; each tile shows one slice of the dither
481	   image and fades on its own random-order schedule, so the resolve reads
482	   as pixels dissolving away rather than a wipe. Built once at init from
483	   the existing .dither-layer <img> (see buildTileGrid in the script). */
