1	# Design Language: Aarke Official Website | Aarke
2	
3	> Extracted from `https://aarke.com` on September 4, 2026
4	> 2869 elements analyzed
5	
6	This document describes the complete design language of the website. It is structured for AI/LLM consumption — use it to faithfully recreate the visual design in any framework.
7	
8	## Color Palette
9	
10	### Neutral Colors
11	
12	| Hex | HSL | Usage Count |
13	|-----|-----|-------------|
14	| `#000000` | hsl(0, 0%, 0%) | 4878 |
15	| `#ffffff` | hsl(0, 0%, 100%) | 985 |
16	| `#3c3c3c` | hsl(0, 0%, 24%) | 27 |
17	| `#efefef` | hsl(0, 0%, 94%) | 18 |
18	| `#adadad` | hsl(0, 0%, 68%) | 7 |
19	| `#101010` | hsl(0, 0%, 6%) | 5 |
20	
21	### Background Colors
22	
23	Used on large-area elements: `#ffffff`, `#ebebeb`, `#000000`
