62	### Heading Scale
63	
64	```css
65	h1 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 33px; }
66	h3 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 27px; }
67	h4 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 20.8px; }
68	h1 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 18.2px; }
